Subject: Configure pnpm workspace linker and dependency overrides
Origin: DHI-internal (DHI build harness)
Description: Set the hoisted node linker and copy imports in the workspace
 file because pnpm rejects these required package-build settings globally.
 Override glob and minimatch versions that remain vulnerable in transitive dependencies.
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/renovatebot/renovate.git 0b268f2d155babbe5d98794f9ec22a607c9ed882
Verify: cmd `grep -xF -e 'nodeLinker: hoisted' -e 'packageImportMethod: copy' -e '  glob@>=9.0.0 <=14.0.1: 14.0.2' -e '  minimatch@<11.0.1: 11.0.1' pnpm-workspace.yaml` expect "linker and dependency settings"
Forwarded: not-needed (DHI package build configuration and dependency overrides)
CVE: CVE-2026-118764
CVE: CVE-2026-118773
Drop-When: never: pnpm accepts nodeLinker/packageImportMethod only in the workspace file, so DHI package builds always need them; recheck the glob/minimatch overrides on each VERSION bump

diff --git a/pnpm-workspace.yaml b/pnpm-workspace.yaml
--- a/pnpm-workspace.yaml
+++ b/pnpm-workspace.yaml
@@ -24,4 +24,6 @@
   esbuild: 'catalog:'
   katex@>=0.11.0 <0.18.2: 0.19.1
   re2js@>=2.2.0 <2.8.7: 2.9.1
+  glob@>=9.0.0 <=14.0.1: 14.0.2
+  minimatch@<11.0.1: 11.0.1
   vite: 'catalog:'
@@ -55 +57,4 @@
 provenance: true
+
+nodeLinker: hoisted
+packageImportMethod: copy
